libsmm-asset (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First stable release.
  * Versioned ABI (SONAME libsmmasset.so.0) exporting only the public API.
  * Structured per-object error reporting and runtime version queries.
  * Hardened HTTP handling; see NEWS for the full summary.
  * Split packaging into libsmmasset0 (runtime) and libsmm-asset-dev
    (header, development symlink, pkg-config file), replacing the single
    libsmm-asset package. The -dev package depends on the libcurl, jansson
    and tidy development packages that smm-asset.pc requires.
  * Stop shipping the libtool archive (.la).

 -- Scott Parlane <sjp@canterburyairpatrol.org>  Fri, 12 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000

